WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.610
Class 3-B?

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:04.760
Ms. Kuroi!

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:05.920
Yeah, yeah...

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:32.460
Thanks for treating us today, Cousin Yui!

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:33.000
Anytime!

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Don't mention it!

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:37.800
That was good, right?

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:38.510
Right?

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:41.680
Don't you feel happy when the egg tastes good?

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:45.560
The price of gas went up two yen since yesterday...

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:46.390
Should've filled up the tank...

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.060
<i>Why is it that people who spend generously...</i>

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:52.150
<i>...care so much about a one yen difference in the price of gasoline?</i>
Should've filled up the tank...

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:55.190
That's right...

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:58.070
That book I lent you a while ago is
apparently getting turned into a game.

00:01:58.070 --> 00:01:59.820
I won't be buying it though.

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:01.700
You're so behind, Kagami.

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:05.580
I reserved the limited edition as soon as it was announced.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:09.270
I even bought the DVD box set for
the anime and other related goods.

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:10.540
You're more hooked than I am.

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:13.880
It's pretty common for people to become bigger
fans than the people who recommend stuff to them.

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:16.500
That's how Cousin Yui chose her car.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.710
Thanks to someone else's influence.

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:18.460
Her car?!

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:21.420
I lent her a racing manga...

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:23.180
That sure surprised me.

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:25.550
It's scary how much energy people put into their hobbies...

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:28.150
Yesterday was the third win in a row, right?

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:30.180
It's the start of a miracle!

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.890
If they keep on winning...

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:33.310
...the playoffs and Japan Series aren't out of the question.
What are they talking about?

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:35.020
Probably pro baseball, I believe.

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:35.610
All the way to the top!

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:37.190
Teacher enjoys it.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:37.900
Besides, baseball's all about...

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:38.820
Speaking of baseball...

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:41.440
The famous poet, Shiki Masaoka...

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:43.570
...apparently loved baseball a great deal.

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:45.530
He played catcher...

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:48.290
...until he was too ill.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:51.170
And he took his childhood name, Noboru...

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:52.960
...wrote it using the characters for baseball...

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:54.830
...and pronounced it Noball.

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:55.500
By the way...

00:02:55.810 --> 00:02:59.710
The winners of the Major League
are called the world champions, right?

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:02.570
Talking about the Japan Series reminded me.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:03.590
That's right.

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:05.510
Even when it only includes American teams.

00:03:05.710 --> 00:03:11.360
Well, they should beat our team before
they call themselves world champions, right?

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:13.770
She's awfully pumped up...

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.850
It sure stinks.

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:17.270
It sure does.

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:18.190
There you are!

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:18.690
Kagami!

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:20.370
Miyuki-san!

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:21.070
Konata.

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:23.370
Teach me how to do these!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:26.240
This is unusual.

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:28.850
You asking a question about schoolwork.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:32.420
Some of these problems are quite difficult.

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:36.540
That's cause they're from an arcade quiz game.

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:39.170
I'm not good with academic stuff.

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:40.920
There you go again...

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.380
And put more effort into your studying.

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:44.720
You're applying for college.

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:47.680
I may be like this here...

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:50.230
...but they call me a sage over there!

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:51.510
In that case...

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:54.520
...just enroll in that whatever academy of yours.

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.850
Which is why I didn't get enough sleep.

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:58.480
How long were you up playing?

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:01.990
You say you're always in bed by eleven, Miyuki-san?

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:03.480
That's early.

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:03.900
Wait.

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:05.990
Now I get it...

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:08.990
So I was thinking when I looked at Miyuki-san...

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:12.410
...but you haven't grown much considering how much you sleep.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.620
That's what Big Sister said.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.460
I'm really sensitive about that.

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:21.920
Excuse me for calling so late.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:23.590
My name is Kobayakawa.

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:25.690
Is this the Iwasaki residence?

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:26.510
Thank you.

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:27.890
May I speak with Minami-chan?

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.140
She already went to bed?

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:32.760
<i>Did she always sleep this early?</i>

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:55.750
You're having fun singing.

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.000
Yes, we'll make do.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:58.920
It's okay.

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.080
Yes.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:02.850
I'll let my father know.

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:04.640
After the ground-breaking ceremony.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.470
That's right.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.630
No, of course not!

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:10.220
Please, there you go again...

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:12.220
I'm underage, really.

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:13.470
You've got it wrong!

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:15.440
It's not like that!

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:17.430
Then bye.

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:18.060
Yes.

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:19.110
Yes!

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:21.400
You know, Kagami...

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:23.810
They can't see you gesturing.

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:24.980
I know that!

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:26.400
It's just a force of habit!

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:27.280
Oh, yeah...

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:32.110
When I'm on the phone, I have to concentrate so I stop gaming...

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:36.380
...but then my empty hand starts feeling lonely...

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:37.540
I know what you mean.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:38.370
So the other day...

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:43.290
...I was using a roller to get rid of dust the whole time.

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.630
Roll! Roll!

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:47.090
Stuff like that can get pretty addictive.

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:50.470
Like random doodling or menial chores.

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:52.130
But you know...

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:56.010
Once you get off the phone, that stuff gets old really fast.

00:05:56.010 --> 00:06:00.360
It's kinda depressing when only the area around you is clean.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.350
You could just finish the job.

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:04.650
My passion fades with the conversation.

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:06.150
So you just leave it like that?

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:10.160
That guy's kinda stinky, yeah?

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:12.530
I guess it's okay every now and then.

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:14.240
Look!

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:14.910
**cky!

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:16.170
Po***!

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:17.410
I used to do that...

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.000
...back in grade school.

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:20.410
Seriously...

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:21.880
Are you a little kid?

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:23.620
But...

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.750
Speaking of things we did when we were little...

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:27.420
...I used to stir my yogurt...

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.760
...and go, "Bread factory!"

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:32.850
Bread factory?

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:34.560
Haven't heard of it?

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:38.510
Hey, what was that just now?

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:39.890
Bread factory?

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:41.770
Don't be embarrassed. Just 'fess up.

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:43.070
Shut up!

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:45.440
About that game I lent you back during first semester...

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.060
Someone else wants to play it.

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:47.900
So give it back.

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:48.480
Gotcha.

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:50.120
Is it for the squirt?

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:51.190
Reminds me...

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:53.240
I've lent a bunch to her.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:54.410
I should get them back.

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:56.450
But you sure are amazing, Hiiragi.

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:57.160
What do you mean?

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:57.950
Well...

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:01.660
The other day, I found these games and
didn't remember who I borrowed them from...

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:03.330
I'm impressed you can remember.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.000
Hey now...

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:07.540
And there are some I lent to other people that I've forgotten about.

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:09.000
You're way too careless.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:09.710
Nah.

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:12.720
There's gotta be a Law of Equal Lending.

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.050
It's a universal principle.

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:15.430
As if...

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:21.720
Yes?

00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:23.250
Hello?

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:24.060
Hiiragi?

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:24.730
It's me.

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:25.520
Misao.

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:27.030
Yeah, what's u—

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:28.980
Damn...

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:30.440
Not bad, Potemkin...

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:31.400
Wh-What?

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.900
Is something wrong?

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:33.440
Nah.

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:34.320
No big deal...

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:35.320
Sorry, sorry.

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:35.740
So?

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:37.220
What do you want?

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.030
Well...

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:41.080
What was it again?

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.370
I wouldn't know.

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:44.330
It was something super important...

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.710
Don't forget it if it's important.

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:48.540
I was looking at the numbers for the Autumn Jumbo Lottery...

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:50.170
...but mine were all off.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:51.920
Guess it's not so easy to win.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:54.510
I sent in a bunch of postcards...

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:56.340
...but I didn't win any prizes from the drawing.

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:57.260
Really...

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:58.770
That's too bad...

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:00.890
When you never win...

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:05.520
...you start to wonder if the vendors or
editors are running some kind of scam, right?

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:06.520
Konata!

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:08.810
You shouldn't be so suspicious of other people!

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:11.610
<i>No good...</i>

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.580
<i>I'm gonna call it a night.</i>

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:16.990
<i>I'll go to the bathroom first.</i>

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:22.580
They tell me that I talk to myself too much.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.420
But that don't matter.

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:30.250
<i>I was really sleepy...</i>

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:34.260
<i>...so why am I so awake after that weird joke?</i>

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.880
<i>I really can't do this at night.</i>

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:40.300
<i>I'm not feeling it tonight...</i>

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:42.600
<i>I should get to bed while I'm dozing off.</i>

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:47.940
It's freezing!

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:51.310
<i>I was really sleepy...</i>

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:55.860
<i>...so why am I so awake just 'cause it's cold under the covers?</i>

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:54.930
You fell in love with Mom...

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:57.180
...and you dote on me...

00:12:57.180 --> 00:12:58.940
...which means you're a lolicon, right?

00:12:58.940 --> 00:12:59.560
No, wait.

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:00.270
Hold it right here.

00:13:00.270 --> 00:13:02.110
That's not entirely accurate.

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:03.860
I'm not limited to little girls.

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:05.190
I also like normal girls.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:07.070
So you should say that I'm <i>also</i> a lolicon.

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:09.780
Well, it basically depends on the character.

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:12.200
Either way, you fail as a human being.

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:13.120
Okay...

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:15.660
You know how you're always so clingy?

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:19.400
Would you still be like that if I were a boy?

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.250
Of course!

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:22.880
Okay.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:24.040
I totally understand now.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:26.210
Aren't you glad I'm a girl?

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:28.260
Uh...

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:30.180
I think the bath should be ready.

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:32.440
You go first, Yu-chan.

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:33.930
Then excuse me.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:36.820
<i>He chased her away 'cause he was looking bad.</i>

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:39.780
Hey, Dad.

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:41.440
About Mom...

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:43.020
She was short...

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:44.980
...and your childhood friend...

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:46.980
Isn't she like a character out of a gal game?

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:48.070
Right?

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:50.690
She was adorable since she was little.

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:53.320
I can understand why you fell for her...

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:55.920
...but why did she marry you?

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:58.580
I was like, "You wouldn't accept me...

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:01.040
...so I ended up as a gal game lover!"

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.750
And she just said yes...

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.180
You're despicable!

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:05.670
But it's the truth.

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:07.420
Isn't that coercion?!

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:08.420
No, no...

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:10.720
That wasn't the only reason, obviously...

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:14.140
And she was really happy when you were born...

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:14.850
Oh.

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:16.890
Doesn't this mole make her look like you, Sou-kun?

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:18.020
Well...

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:20.020
She has your eyes.

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:22.520
You can definitely tell she's our child.

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:26.520
But I hope she doesn't grow up like us.

00:14:26.520 --> 00:14:28.030
I hope she doesn't inherit my height...

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:30.440
...or your personality...

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:31.820
Pretty harsh...

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:35.250
But why did you suddenly mention her?

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:39.040
I don't know much about Mom.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:43.580
Konata.

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:46.430
Are you lonely without Mom around?

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:48.300
Not really.

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:51.260
You create as much excitement as two people would.

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:53.470
And Yu-chan's here.

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:55.020
I see...

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:56.180
<i>Kanata...</i>

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:58.760
<i>Konata's grown up to be a good girl.</i>

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:01.810
<i>Though she's not as normal as you wanted...</i>

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:04.950
Hey, Konata.

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:10.320
Please don't die before I do.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:13.070
For now, I have no intention of doing so.

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:13.650
That's good.

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.570
Kanata died young...

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:19.790
...but she said she was happy and smiled at the end.

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:22.200
It's hard on those left behind...

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:24.620
...but I want to be like that at the end.

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:25.830
Smiling?

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:27.710
So how do you want to die?

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:28.800
Let's see...

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:30.090
Death by moe?

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:33.010
You're definitely going to have a bizarre death!

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:35.050
That's right...

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:38.510
I bought a digital camera for work today...

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:59.340
I haven't been back in a while.

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:00.700
You're so annoying!

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:01.080
Come on!

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:01.290
I wonder what...

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:02.080
Just one more!

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:02.790
Okay?
I wonder what...

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:02.870
Geez! I'm in the middle of a game!

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:04.500
...they're doing right now.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:05.250
Okay! Okay!

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:06.290
Okay! Cheese!

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:08.260
Come on, Dad!

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:12.370
Okay, one more!

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:13.590
That's enough already.

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:15.590
And Dad, you're way too close.

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:17.590
You're so heartless, Konata.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:21.100
We're taking photos to commemorate this new camera!

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:22.890
Didn't you buy this for work?

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:23.390
Don't be such a stiff!

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:24.520
Honestly...

00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:24.930
Sou-kun hasn't changed.

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:25.810
One more picture!

00:16:25.810 --> 00:16:26.520
That's enough.
Sou-kun hasn't changed.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:26.810
That's right, you never did...
That's enough.

00:16:26.810 --> 00:16:28.350
You're such a pest.
That's right, you never did...

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:30.610
...pay much attention to what other people wanted.
You're such a pest.

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:31.730
Take that!

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:32.190
Ow.

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:33.620
That hurts, Konata!

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:38.450
You really haven't changed.

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:39.740
But you know...

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:43.240
You feel more and more like Kanata when I hold you.

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:44.450
It makes my heart race.

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:44.950
<i>Hey!</i>

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:48.080
<i>Don't just blurt out risqué statements!</i>

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:51.420
I can see what Mom had to put up with...

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:52.670
What was that?!

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:53.590
Indeed...

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.560
Your dad may be like that...

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:57.470
...but don't turn into a bad person.

00:16:58.050 --> 00:16:59.220
That's right, Konata.

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:02.760
Teach me that one game once you clear it.

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:03.970
Okay.

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:06.520
That one's surprisingly difficult.

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:06.930
But...

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:07.520
I think I made a wrong choice somewhere...

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:09.440
They play games together...

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:10.770
...so it looks like they're getting along.
I think I made a wrong choice somewhere...

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:13.480
I can't make it to the H-scene for the character I want.

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:14.400
Wait!

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:16.900
What are you letting your daughter play?!

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:18.030
Geez...

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:19.700
Is this really okay?

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:22.370
Aren't you teaching her the wrong things, Sou-kun?

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:24.370
Hey.

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:27.330
Why did Mom choose you?

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:30.920
'Cause you're just a perverted, lolicon, old geek.

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:32.630
People usually don't go for that.

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:33.880
That's a little harsh.

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:36.630
You don't go easy on your old man, huh?

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:37.760
For real.

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:38.590
But that's right...

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:39.300
Honestly...

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:39.840
Kanata had really good intuition.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:41.840
You were always like this...

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:43.800
Always making me almost forget...

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:45.470
Maybe it was fate.

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:47.770
...why I chose to spend...

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:49.310
Even though I failed as a human being...

00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:51.940
...my life with this man.

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:55.030
...there was one thing I was absolutely sure about.

00:17:57.570 --> 00:18:00.240
One thing you were absolutely sure about?

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:01.830
What was that?

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:06.790
I was...

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:09.580
...the one who loved Kanata most in this world.

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:16.640
That was it.

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:20.350
I just can't beat you.

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:55.970
He accepts my good and bad parts.

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:59.380
He's willing to show both...

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.450
...his good and bad parts.

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:09.720
The place I feel most at ease...

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:13.820
The place that lets me feel most at ease...

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:16.910
Yeah?

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:18.690
Okay!

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:19.860
That's enough reminiscing.

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:21.230
Let's take another one?

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:21.900
We'll do one with Yu-chan later, okay?

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:23.610
The fact that I can no longer be there...

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:24.650
That's enough...

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:25.110
And that would be more than one picture.

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:26.330
...hurts a little.

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:26.910
It's all good.

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:29.580
You bought this for your hobby, didn't you?

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:30.620
Geez.

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:31.750
What are you talking about?

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:35.250
I'm just testing it out before I take pictures for work.

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:35.540
But...

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:36.650
Man...

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:39.840
If I can live on inside them...

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:43.470
...the way the two of them exist inside me...

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:46.810
...I'll continue to watch over them.

00:19:47.140 --> 00:19:47.550
There!

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:47.680
Here we go!

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:50.640
May the ones who brought me so much joy...

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:51.390
Okay.

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:51.430
...be blessed with happiness.

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:54.280
Cheese!

00:19:58.190 --> 00:20:00.290
I wonder if they'll be surprised.

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:01.570
D-Dad!

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:02.740
This picture...

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:06.990
There's a shadow back there...

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:08.960
A real ghost picture...

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:10.330
H-Huh?

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:12.370
I'm done with my bath.

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:12.870
Yu—

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:13.450
Yu-Yu-Yu-Yu-chan!

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:14.840
W-Wait!

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:16.460
L-L-Look at this!

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:17.080
What is it?

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:17.970
What's wrong?

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:19.250
D-Delete it!

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:20.670
We have to delete it!

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:21.710
We'll be cursed!

00:20:21.710 --> 00:20:22.670
S-Stop!

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:23.760
Don't delete it!

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:24.460
Wait!

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:25.380
Deleting it isn't enough!

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:27.550
Don't we have to burn it?

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:29.560
Don't burn it!

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:33.180
Now that I've talked with her...

00:20:33.180 --> 00:20:35.100
...I have a different impression of her...

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:38.440
...but Mina-rin still seems a little scary.

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:41.170
But she's really nice.

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.490
She's back!

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:45.190
Minami-chan!

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:46.650
Welcome back!

00:20:46.650 --> 00:20:47.360
I'm back.

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:47.490
<i>Those two are really close.</i>

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:49.620
You had classroom duty today, right?

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:49.990
<i>Those two are really close.</i>

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:51.370
Was the teacher still in the faculty office?

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:52.240
<i>This would be...</i>

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:54.700
<i>Yutaka, your tie is crooked.</i>

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:56.330
<i>B-Big Sister..</i>

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:57.540
<i>I mustn't!</i>

00:20:57.540 --> 00:20:59.420
<i>I'm looking at my friends weird again...</i>

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:01.680
<i>Maybe it's been building up.</i>

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:06.050
Three!

00:21:06.050 --> 00:21:06.920
Two!

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:08.010
One!

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:09.100
Start!

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:11.850
So did you find them?

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:13.220
Can't find them anywhere?

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:14.350
And you can't find their managers?

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:16.270
They ran away...

00:21:16.270 --> 00:21:17.640
Well, either way, they're fired.

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:18.190
Uh...

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:18.980
Besides...

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:19.020
It's rolling...

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:22.110
I had a bad feeling about this show from the beginning!

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:22.230
U-Uh...

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:22.980
You know?

00:21:22.980 --> 00:21:23.690
Fact...

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:25.730
I actually refused in the beginning.

00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:27.440
But all that politics crap.

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:27.990
Grown-up issues and whatnot.

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:29.200
Uh...

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:30.800
Uh, it's rolling.

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:31.780
What's rolling?

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:32.160
Me?

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:32.620
You?

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:33.620
Or the earth?

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:34.830
No, that's not what I meant.

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:35.490
Then what.

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:37.200
I'm saying that the camera's rolling!

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:37.660
Idiot!

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:38.420
Turn it off!

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:42.290
Isono!

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:43.360
What is it, Nakajima?!

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:46.490
Now, please listen to me!

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:46.960
This time!

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:48.960
This time, it's the medley version!

00:22:59.630 --> 00:23:02.030
You didn't change when I blew the whistle.

00:23:02.970 --> 00:23:05.200
You kept finishing Dentistman.

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:06.140
Yep.

00:23:06.140 --> 00:23:06.440
I did.

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:07.040
Why?

00:23:07.040 --> 00:23:08.440
Just switch.

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:13.740
Well, next time on Lucky Star:

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:14.620
I'm Soujirou.

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:15.910
I'm Kanata.

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:16.760
Then Sou-kun...

00:23:16.760 --> 00:23:18.130
I'll be heading off now.

00:23:18.130 --> 00:23:19.380
Are you leaving?

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:21.920
Take me with you.

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:24.170
I don't know how to leave my body yet...

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:25.500
...but I'm sure I can learn!

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:28.590
Sou-kun, you're talking about manga or anime again, aren't you?

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:29.850
Then see you later.

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:31.930
Kanata!

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:32.640
Next time:

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:34.510
A Fine Line.

00:23:34.510 --> 00:23:35.180
Sou-kun!

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:37.700
I can't fly with all the turbulence!

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:38.530
Hey now...
